<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Generative Probabilistic Time Series Forecasting and Applications in Grid Operations
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>This work was supported in part by the National Science Foundation under Award 2218110.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
